                : 'Moving beyond constrained laboratory tasks to track real-time neural dynamics during immersion in cinema, literature, and music. Decoding the momentary deconstruction of the Default Mode Network (DMN) during sublime awe, discovering how aesthetic experiences foster psychiatric healing.'}
